      "rationale": "No PubMed evidence context was provided to verify this mechanism."
    },
    {
      "claim": "Thalidomide binding alters CRBN substrate specificity to recruit and promote the polyubiquitination and proteasomal degradation of IKZF1 and IKZF3.",
